From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:25:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 216/488] soh: rename D_80BA5900 -> sSunGraveSparkTextures
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: void* table of gEffSunGraveSpark1Tex … 8Tex bound to segment 0x08 by effect timer, mirroring the sEffLightningTextures table above it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c
index 3c551a89a..828374e46 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Object_Kankyo/z_object_kankyo.c
@@ -43,7 +43,8 @@ static void* sEffLightningTextures[] = {
     gEffLightning5Tex, gEffLightning6Tex, gEffLightning7Tex, gEffLightning8Tex,
 };
 
-static void* D_80BA5900[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80BA5900: void* table of gEffSunGraveSpark1Tex … 8Tex bound to segment 0x08 by effect timer, mirroring the sEffLightningTextures table above it.
+static void* sSunGraveSparkTextures[] = {  // was D_80BA5900 [LLM:HIGH]
     gEffSunGraveSpark1Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark2Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark3Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark4Tex,
     gEffSunGraveSpark5Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark6Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark7Tex, gEffSunGraveSpark8Tex,
 };
@@ -862,7 +863,7 @@ void ObjectKankyo_DrawSunGraveSpark(ObjectKankyo* this2, PlayState* play2) {
             Matrix_Mult(&play->billboardMtxF, MTXMODE_APPLY);
             gSPMatrix(POLY_XLU_DISP++, MATRIX_NEWMTX(play->state.gfxCtx), G_MTX_LOAD);
 
-            gSPSegment(POLY_XLU_DISP++, 0x08, SEGMENTED_TO_VIRTUAL(D_80BA5900[this->effects[0].timer]));
+            gSPSegment(POLY_XLU_DISP++, 0x08, SEGMENTED_TO_VIRTUAL(sSunGraveSparkTextures[this->effects[0].timer]));  // was D_80BA5900 [LLM:HIGH]
             gDPPipeSync(POLY_XLU_DISP++);
 
             gSPDisplayList(POLY_XLU_DISP++, object_spot02_objects_DL_009620);
@@ -956,4 +957,4 @@ void ObjectKankyo_DrawBeams(ObjectKankyo* this2, PlayState* play2) {
 void ObjectKankyo_Reset(void) {
     sIsSpawned = false;
     sTrailingFairies = 0;
-}
\ No newline at end of file
+}
